    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like even a \"break\" is just temporary. like i'll just wake up the next day and have to do the whole exhausting thing all over again. it's like a loop i can't get out of. sometimes i wonder if there's actually a way to just... have real peace. like, actually stop the noise for good.",
